{"note_id":53,"date":"2025-03-18","note_type":"Operative Pathology Report","content":"Procedure performed 2025-03-18: left breast lumpectomy with sentinel lymph node biopsy. Final surgical pathology shows invasive ductal carcinoma, 2.4 cm, Nottingham grade 2, with associated intermediate-grade DCIS. Margins negative for invasive carcinoma and DCIS. Three sentinel lymph nodes examined, all negative for carcinoma (0/3). Pathologic stage pT2 pN0(sn). Post-op recovery uncomplicated aside from mild axillary soreness and a small resolving seroma.","summary":"The operative pathology report details a left breast lumpectomy with sentinel lymph node biopsy, revealing a 2.4 cm invasive ductal carcinoma, grade 2, with intermediate‑grade DCIS and negative margins. All three sentinel nodes were negative, resulting in pathologic stage pT2 N0(sn). Post‑operative recovery was uncomplicated aside from mild axillary soreness and a resolving seroma.","concepts":{"cancer":{"presence":true,"confidence":"high","evidence":[{"note_id":53,"text":"invasive ductal carcinoma"}]},"metastasis":{"presence":false,"confidence":"high","evidence":[]},"surgery":{"presence":true,"confidence":"high","evidence":[{"note_id":53,"text":"left breast lumpectomy with sentinel lymph node biopsy"}]},"chemotherapy":{"presence":false,"confidence":"high","evidence":[]},"radiation":{"presence":false,"confidence":"high","evidence":[]},"lymph_nodes_removed":{"presence":true,"confidence":"high","evidence":[{"note_id":53,"text":"sentinel lymph node biopsy"},{"note_id":53,"text":"Three sentinel lymph nodes examined"}]}},"cancer_status":["current"],"cancer_mentions":[{"presence":true,"confidence":"high","evidence":[{"note_id":53,"text":"invasive ductal carcinoma, 2.4 cm, Nottingham grade 2, with associated intermediate-grade DCIS"}],"status":"current","affected_tissue":"left breast","metastasis":false}],"flags":["lumpectomy","invasive ductal carcinoma","sentinel lymph node biopsy","negative margins","pT2 N0","postoperative