{"note_id":55,"date":"2025-04-10","note_type":"Systemic Therapy Note","content":"Genomic assay returned in the intermediate-high range, and adjuvant chemotherapy was recommended. Docetaxel/cyclophosphamide cycle 1 was administered on 2025-04-10. She tolerated infusion with expected fatigue and transient metallic taste, no febrile symptoms. Radiation oncology referral placed for adjuvant whole-breast radiation after completion of chemotherapy. Endocrine therapy to follow radiation. The patient asked whether the in situ component changes the main diagnosis; we reviewed that the invasive component drives prognosis and treatment planning.","summary":"An intermediate-high genomic assay led to recommendation of adjuvant chemotherapy, and the first cycle of docetaxel/cyclophosphamide was administered with expected tolerance. A referral for adjuvant whole-breast radiation after chemotherapy and planned subsequent endocrine therapy were placed. The patient inquired about the impact of an in situ component, and it was clarified that the invasive component dictates prognosis and treatment.","concepts":{"cancer":{"presence":true,"confidence":"high","evidence":[{"note_id":55,"text":"the patient asked whether the in situ component changes the main diagnosis; we reviewed that the invasive component drives prognosis"}]},"metastasis":{"presence":false,"confidence":"high","evidence":[]},"surgery":{"presence":false,"confidence":"high","evidence":[]},"chemotherapy":{"presence":true,"confidence":"high","evidence":[{"note_id":55,"text":"Docetaxel/cyclophosphamide cycle 1 was administered on 2025-04-10"}]},"radiation":{"presence":true,"confidence":"high","evidence":[{"note_id":55,"text":"Radiation oncology referral placed for adjuvant whole-breast radiation after completion of chemotherapy"}]},"lymph_nodes_removed":{"presence":false,"confidence":"high","evidence":[]}},"cancer_status":["current"],"cancer_mentions":[{"presence":true,"confidence":"high","evidence":[{"note_id":55,"text":"Genomic assay returned in the intermediate-high range, and adjuvant chemotherapy was recommended"}],"status":"current","affected_tissue":"breast","metastasis":false}],"flags":["genomic assay","adjuvant chemotherapy","docetaxel cyclophosphamide","radiation referral","endocrine therapy","invasive component"]}

