mic assay returned in the intermediate-high range, and adjuvant chemotherapy was recommended"}],"status":"current","affected_tissue":"breast","metastasis":false}],"flags":["genomic assay","adjuvant chemotherapy","docetaxel cyclophosphamide","radiation referral","endocrine therapy","invasive component"]}

